WEBVTT

00:00.967 --> 00:02.259
What the hell…

00:02.385 --> 00:06.097
I'm feeling lucky, and a little
target practice might do me good!

00:07.139 --> 00:07.973
Yes!

00:08.057 --> 00:09.767
Th-That was close…

00:09.850 --> 00:11.601
If I hadn't returned
to my normal size,

00:11.644 --> 00:12.770
I would've been done for!

00:13.437 --> 00:14.479
If time hadn't been on my side,

00:14.564 --> 00:18.651
and you hadn't shrunk to
a diminutive weakling…

00:18.734 --> 00:20.110
I would've been a goner!

00:20.194 --> 00:22.487
I-I didn't get him!

00:24.407 --> 00:26.492
D-Damn it.

00:26.909 --> 00:31.409
Could my Stand's power have
shrunk along with my body?

00:33.666 --> 00:35.292
Little bastard's moving again!

00:35.334 --> 00:36.960
Come back, Li'l Bomber!

00:39.505 --> 00:41.965
I want him to taste
some major pain,

00:42.133 --> 00:43.801
but for now, I gotta hide.

00:44.135 --> 00:45.970
He's completely flipping out…

00:46.012 --> 00:48.222
If he finds me,
he'll do whatever it takes

00:48.264 --> 00:51.100
to get me to squeal on
the boss's daughter.

00:55.980 --> 00:57.439
I-It's so wide!

00:58.274 --> 01:00.776
Why's the sidewalk
have to be so damn big?!

01:03.779 --> 01:06.072
Move! Out of the way, shit!

01:14.707 --> 01:15.916
Damn it…

01:26.636 --> 01:28.304
Well, look what we've got here.

01:28.554 --> 01:30.681
This has been fun…

01:30.848 --> 01:33.183
You really are a slippery cazzo.

01:33.684 --> 01:36.228
Once Tiny Feet
has broken your skin,

01:36.312 --> 01:38.689
there's no escaping
your infinitesimal fate.

01:38.773 --> 01:40.232
Now, let's talk…

01:40.483 --> 01:42.067
Where is Bucciarati
and his flunkies

01:42.151 --> 01:45.028
hiding the boss's daughter?

01:45.071 --> 01:47.364
K-Kill me!

01:47.657 --> 01:50.368
Dammit, just hurry up and do it!

01:50.409 --> 01:54.204
You really think I value
my own life more than

01:54.288 --> 01:57.708
keeping my friends
out of harm's way!

02:01.671 --> 02:06.050
<i>Narancia Ghirga,
born a Leo in 1984.</i>

02:07.343 --> 02:09.178
<i>At the age often…</i>

02:09.679 --> 02:11.806
N-Narancia…

02:15.226 --> 02:17.269
I'm here, Mamma.

02:20.690 --> 02:21.732
Mamma…

02:26.362 --> 02:27.738
Hey, Pappa…

02:28.406 --> 02:30.491
about Mamma's eye sickness…

02:38.624 --> 02:40.083
Pezzo di merda…

02:40.751 --> 02:45.251
<i>It was the beginning of what
would become Narancia's new life.</i>

02:56.559 --> 03:01.059
<i>Heavy stones of fate
are holding down my dreams</i>

03:01.897 --> 03:05.400
<i>It feels as if I'm being crushed</i>

03:07.153 --> 03:11.653
<i>I've been staggering around
with nowhere to hide</i>

03:12.324 --> 03:16.161
<i>But I will never give in</i>

03:16.245 --> 03:20.745
<i>I know there are fragments of hope
buried beneath all that rubble</i>

03:28.007 --> 03:32.507
<i>I will find them with my own hands
and turn this world upside down</i>

03:41.103 --> 03:45.603
<i>Fighting gold
We will shine one day</i>

03:47.067 --> 03:51.567
<i>As long as we continue to
believe in our own path</i>

03:54.116 --> 03:57.285
<i>We are unyielding souls</i>

03:57.328 --> 04:01.828
<i>Our battle against god
will keep raging on</i>

04:02.583 --> 04:07.083
<i>Until our final days
Fighting gold</i>

04:16.847 --> 04:21.347
EPISODE 11
NARANCIA'S LI'L BOMBER

04:18.140 --> 04:20.851
<i>'Sousa, I need you to
explain something for me.</i>

04:21.727 --> 04:24.813
How many minutes would it take me
to walk here, you think?

04:24.855 --> 04:27.315
- Minutes?
<i>- Narancia rebel led against his father.</i>

04:27.358 --> 04:28.525
- That'd take you hours.
<i>- He began to fraternize</i>

04:28.526 --> 04:29.735
- That'd take you hours.
<i>- with the wrong crowd,</i>

04:29.819 --> 04:33.864
<i>refusing to come home and surviving
on whatever he stole that day</i>

04:34.198 --> 04:35.657
Wow, it really worked!

04:35.699 --> 04:38.368
Couldn't have done it without
your info on that store, big bro.

04:38.494 --> 04:40.871
I don't know, shouldn't you
be going to school?

04:40.996 --> 04:43.164
I mean, you have a decent family.

04:43.999 --> 04:45.417
You think I give
a shit about them?

04:45.793 --> 04:49.087
All that matters in this world
are your true friends!

04:49.672 --> 04:50.714
Yeah.

04:51.423 --> 04:53.633
Dye your hair blond like mine.

04:53.717 --> 04:56.052
You're gonna look so damn cool.

04:56.804 --> 04:57.805
Yeah!

04:59.807 --> 05:01.433
Oh shit, you really did it.

05:01.517 --> 05:03.227
So?

05:03.310 --> 05:04.519
You look like a tool!

05:05.145 --> 05:06.813
Hey, where's big bro?

05:06.897 --> 05:09.149
Dunno, haven't seen him
for a few days.

05:09.567 --> 05:10.609
Huh…

05:10.693 --> 05:12.653
<i>Then, the very next day…</i>

05:14.530 --> 05:15.697
- You bastards!
- Get those grubby hands

05:15.698 --> 05:17.199
- You bastards!
- on the wall, now.

05:17.241 --> 05:18.200
- Little cazzo…
- What the hell are you talking about?!

05:18.200 --> 05:19.159
- Hope you like juvie 'cause you're
- What the hell are you talking about?!

05:19.201 --> 05:20.744
- Gonna spend a good long time there.
- You think I was robbing a…?!

05:20.786 --> 05:21.787
But I wasn't—

05:22.079 --> 05:24.831
Nice freakin' try kid,
I've got a witness!

05:24.915 --> 05:25.916
Wha—?!

05:26.542 --> 05:29.336
That's him! That blond terror
is the one who did it!

05:29.712 --> 05:30.796
- I didn't…
- He lies…

05:30.880 --> 05:33.841
He beat me black and blue
and took all my money!

05:33.883 --> 05:37.261
You better come clean, old bag…
I'm innocent!

05:38.470 --> 05:41.806
That's enough, now confess, segone!

05:41.891 --> 05:42.600
Hold it!

05:42.600 --> 05:43.767
Now I know we need answers,
but you need to let the boy go!

05:43.809 --> 05:45.393
You did see him, didn't you?

05:45.436 --> 05:47.604
He was just going
to hit her again!

05:54.570 --> 05:55.696
A robber…

05:56.780 --> 05:59.324
A blond terror…

06:00.451 --> 06:01.535
Could it be…?

06:05.414 --> 06:07.499
No, he would never!

06:07.583 --> 06:09.793
I gotta stop thinking
like this, dammit!

06:11.754 --> 06:14.631
<i>Narancia was released
one year later,</i>

06:14.715 --> 06:17.008
<i>but in extremely poor health.</i>

06:17.384 --> 06:19.219
<i>The officer had injured his eye,</i>

06:19.470 --> 06:22.973
<i>and the infection that
resulted was unrelenting.</i>

06:25.601 --> 06:30.101
<i>When he finally returned home,
his friends acted peculiarly</i>

06:30.272 --> 06:31.606
Look.

06:31.649 --> 06:33.692
His mom had some weird problem
with her eye too,

06:33.776 --> 06:35.152
and she died from it.

06:35.778 --> 06:37.279
<i>How could they know about that?</i>

06:37.321 --> 06:39.448
<i>That was a secret
between big bro and me…</i>

06:39.531 --> 06:42.283
Interesting, out already?

06:44.620 --> 06:45.871
Well, don't spread whatever
that is to me.

06:46.080 --> 06:48.207
I don't want you
getting anywhere near me.

06:51.877 --> 06:54.880
<i>I don't believe it. Big Bro is…</i>

06:55.547 --> 06:58.299
<i>He was caught,
so he blamed the whole thing on me…</i>

06:58.801 --> 07:01.303
<i>But the rumors
about that horrible disease</i>

07:01.345 --> 07:05.349
<i>scared no one more than
Narancia himself</i>

07:06.183 --> 07:08.185
So this is my destiny…

07:08.268 --> 07:10.937
Soon, it'll get me
just like it did Mamma…

07:11.063 --> 07:13.190
This eye infection
is gonna kill me!

07:13.524 --> 07:16.568
<i>Hope had left him.
There was nowhere to go.</i>

07:16.652 --> 07:18.195
<i>No shoulder to cry on.</i>

07:19.321 --> 07:22.866
<i>Narancia, at the age of fifteen,
awaited only death.</i>

07:22.908 --> 07:25.201
It's sad… He's just a kid.

07:25.327 --> 07:28.163
It's terrible, yes, but in the end,
it's best to keep your distance.

07:40.342 --> 07:43.470
<i>The boy led Narancia
into a local Trattoria,</i>

07:43.554 --> 07:46.890
<i>and had a word for his friend
and the maitre d' waiting…</i>

07:47.099 --> 07:49.434
I want to order this kid
some spaghetti.

07:49.518 --> 07:50.769
You don't mind, do you?

07:53.022 --> 07:56.358
<i>His friend asked not
a single question,</i>

07:56.692 --> 07:59.236
<i>his face showed
no sign of annoyance.</i>

07:59.319 --> 08:02.113
<i>He simply placed the plate of food
he had ordered for himself</i>

08:02.197 --> 08:04.866
<i>in front of the disheveled boy.</i>

08:06.368 --> 08:09.579
<i>He then made sure the boy received
proper medical treatment.</i>

08:10.372 --> 08:11.706
<i>Three weeks later…</i>

08:12.332 --> 08:15.251
Why would you go through
all this trouble for me?

08:15.753 --> 08:16.795
I've no pretext.

08:17.129 --> 08:20.507
The choice is yours,
but know that my home is yours.

08:20.549 --> 08:23.426
I strongly suggest you go back home
to your parents.

08:23.510 --> 08:25.887
You need to go to school.
Got it?

08:26.221 --> 08:29.724
U-Um, are you by
any chance a mafioso?

08:33.687 --> 08:35.313
I don't want to go back home.

08:35.814 --> 08:37.649
I want to work with you and
become a mafioso like you!

08:37.733 --> 08:40.736
This isn't some fun game we're
playing here, my little coglione!

08:41.487 --> 08:43.864
Spew that kind of
asinine shit again,

08:44.156 --> 08:45.866
and I'll hit you harder
than you ever felt!

08:46.742 --> 08:49.119
<i>Narancia took his words to heart</i>

08:49.203 --> 08:52.247
<i>and returned home where
he resumed his studies at school.</i>

08:52.873 --> 08:56.918
<i>But he would never again trust
the man who was his father.</i>

09:02.674 --> 09:06.386
<i>Why did that guy get so serious
with me all of a sudden back there?</i>

09:07.262 --> 09:09.389
<i>It's not like I have anything
to work toward.</i>

09:10.099 --> 09:11.141
<i>But…</i>

09:11.600 --> 09:14.603
<i>his anger had no resentment
or hatred</i>

09:14.603 --> 09:17.731
<i>There was nothing about it
that was meant to insult.</i>

09:18.357 --> 09:19.983
<i>It had nothing in common
with the kind of anger</i>

09:20.025 --> 09:21.818
<i>my dad and those cops
always spat at me.</i>

09:22.361 --> 09:24.404
<i>When I think back to that day,</i>

09:24.446 --> 09:26.823
<i>it's like his words
filled me with courage.</i>

09:27.449 --> 09:28.825
<i>It's a real warrior…</i>

09:29.660 --> 09:32.287
who joins forces with
a guy like him!

09:32.329 --> 09:34.998
<i>Six months later,
Narancia decided to meet</i>

09:35.040 --> 09:39.127
<i>the capo Polpo without
Bucciarati's knowing…</i>

09:39.711 --> 09:42.171
<i>Narancia passed the mafioso test.</i>

09:45.134 --> 09:47.052
Narancia,
if you have any inclination

09:47.136 --> 09:49.346
to tell me where you've been
hiding that girl,

09:49.429 --> 09:52.348
now is probably the time to do it.

09:52.391 --> 09:53.892
That girl you're
planning on abducting

09:53.976 --> 09:55.936
isn't a mafioso or
anything remotely close!

09:55.978 --> 09:57.479
She's just a freakin' kid, dammit!

09:57.521 --> 09:59.356
Bucciarati knows how to
respect a command,

09:59.439 --> 10:01.691
but not when it comes to
shit like this!

10:02.025 --> 10:03.735
It's called basic human decency!

10:03.819 --> 10:06.196
We said we would protect her,

10:06.488 --> 10:09.073
and that's exactly
what we're gonna do!

10:12.119 --> 10:14.913
You really need to give up
this bullshit chivalrous act.

10:15.330 --> 10:16.873
Why do I even…?

10:17.457 --> 10:19.083
All this heroic bullshit
about friendship,

10:19.168 --> 10:20.836
loyalty, and saving some girl…

10:20.878 --> 10:23.881
I'm not interested in any
of that pointless gobbledygook.

10:24.339 --> 10:27.550
What I'm interested in is
taking down good ol' boss,

10:27.593 --> 10:31.179
and enjoying a drug route
worth hundreds of billions.

10:31.513 --> 10:32.764
Y-You bastard!

10:36.351 --> 10:38.019
That's hundreds of billions!

10:38.061 --> 10:41.314
You don't think a few heads are
gonna roll along the way!

10:41.523 --> 10:43.483
That loot might as well
have our name on it…

10:43.525 --> 10:45.652
'cause no way in hell
we'd turn back now!

10:45.694 --> 10:47.654
If that girl really is
the boss's daughter by blood,

10:47.696 --> 10:50.573
then you better believe
she's a Stand user!

10:51.158 --> 10:54.035
Of course the boss wants to
keep all that under wraps!

10:54.077 --> 10:56.454
That girl's special power
is the very window

10:56.538 --> 10:57.914
into the boss's identity!

10:57.998 --> 11:00.583
She's our big clue…

11:00.626 --> 11:03.045
She's our ticket to taking down
signore incognito!

11:03.420 --> 11:06.464
What? That girl's a Stand user?

11:06.590 --> 11:07.757
Perhaps you've heard…

11:07.925 --> 11:10.052
South America is home to
a species of arachnid

11:10.093 --> 11:11.552
known as the southern black widow.

11:11.887 --> 11:15.265
Apparently, its venom is
particularly lethal to humans.

11:15.390 --> 11:17.600
This guy, on the other hand,
is not venomous.

11:17.726 --> 11:20.145
I caught him in the sewer
a little while back…

11:20.229 --> 11:21.855
He's completely harmless.

11:22.397 --> 11:24.482
But…

11:24.733 --> 11:26.609
Even the most benign of spiders

11:26.652 --> 11:28.779
deliver a bit of toxin
with their nibble.

11:28.862 --> 11:31.781
- For paralyzing and devouring tiny pests,
- Y-You aren't gonna…

11:31.865 --> 11:34.075
however, it works like a charm!

11:34.117 --> 11:35.118
Li'I Bomber!

11:36.745 --> 11:37.787
Whoa, there!

11:39.081 --> 11:43.293
Hey, weren't you listening?
I said your Stand's got nothing!

11:45.337 --> 11:49.799
This bottle is gonna serve
as your private arena, Narancia!

11:51.593 --> 11:54.387
Y-You bastard! Hey!

11:59.476 --> 12:01.311
He's got his eyes right on you!

12:01.770 --> 12:03.480
Each and every one
of his eight eyes

12:03.563 --> 12:05.481
is watching your every
teeny-weeny move!

12:05.524 --> 12:07.359
Let me out… I swear,
you better let me out!

12:08.277 --> 12:09.695
Damn it!

12:10.070 --> 12:13.073
Listen, don't assume his bite
will dispatch you

12:13.115 --> 12:15.033
swiftly and painlessly.

12:15.117 --> 12:17.911
His venom will first
paralyze your muscles,

12:17.953 --> 12:20.038
rendering you entirely immobile.

12:20.289 --> 12:22.541
But it's what happens after you
enter into your state of paralysis

12:22.624 --> 12:23.666
that is really terrifying.

12:24.209 --> 12:26.044
He will grab hold of you and

12:26.128 --> 12:29.172
inject both a venom and a digestive
enzyme deep into your body.

12:29.256 --> 12:32.509
The deadly cocktail of enzymes
will then slowly, but surely,

12:32.551 --> 12:35.971
liquefy your insides
into a pulpy, viscous slime.

12:36.013 --> 12:38.181
Then finally slurpity, slurp.

12:38.348 --> 12:40.850
Keep in mind you will be
fully conscious.

12:40.892 --> 12:42.852
So even though he will
be lunching on your flesh,

12:42.936 --> 12:44.145
you will still be able to speak.

12:44.187 --> 12:48.024
But I strongly urge you
to spill the beans now.

12:48.233 --> 12:51.027
Just tell me where
you're hiding that damn girl.

12:51.111 --> 12:53.321
I really would prefer
not to have to watch

12:53.363 --> 12:56.366
some kid become the liquid lunch
of some giant spider.

12:58.035 --> 12:59.661
I-It's fast!

13:01.038 --> 13:02.205
You bastard!

13:04.624 --> 13:05.625
A shard of glass?!

13:06.501 --> 13:08.127
Where the hell did
he pick up that thing?!

13:09.421 --> 13:10.547
W-Webbing?

13:11.089 --> 13:12.548
When did…?

13:20.515 --> 13:21.682
It bit him!

13:26.438 --> 13:30.191
Enjoying the convulsions
and paralysis yet…?

13:30.233 --> 13:31.943
Just hurry up and come clean.

13:31.985 --> 13:34.445
You do know this is your last
chance to save your own hide.

13:36.448 --> 13:38.867
Merda… Think I'd ever cave to you…?

13:39.201 --> 13:40.744
- Looks like he's pumping you
- Freakin' hell!

13:40.744 --> 13:42.746
- Full of digestive enzymes.
- Freakin' hell!

13:42.913 --> 13:44.539
Now your organs will melt…

13:44.664 --> 13:45.665
Huh?

13:46.041 --> 13:47.083
What's that?

13:47.209 --> 13:51.338
You dropped this when
you took that shard

13:51.463 --> 13:55.550
of glass out of your pocket,
so I picked it up…

13:55.884 --> 14:00.384
I think I might have
all I need right here.

14:01.515 --> 14:03.099
This is a map of the city.

14:03.225 --> 14:05.644
It's a driving map.
Not only that…

14:06.019 --> 14:08.438
This thing is covered
in pencil markings.

14:08.480 --> 14:10.356
Looks like someone was
trying not to get lost!

14:10.774 --> 14:12.817
Could you be any dumber?!

14:12.984 --> 14:14.610
I just have to follow
your little path

14:14.653 --> 14:16.571
right back to where
you started from!

14:17.072 --> 14:18.948
A vineyard!

14:19.032 --> 14:22.827
You came from a vineyard that's
about twenty kilometers southeast!

14:23.036 --> 14:25.455
Grazie, Narancia!

14:25.580 --> 14:27.790
Have fun being eaten alive
and being turned into

14:27.833 --> 14:29.793
some big gross egg sack
or something,

14:30.085 --> 14:31.920
idiot a!

14:35.549 --> 14:37.467
TINY FEET
FORMAGGIO

14:37.884 --> 14:39.468
Twenty kilometers southeast!

14:39.553 --> 14:42.055
Then the boss's daughter will
be ripe for the picking!

14:44.266 --> 14:47.269
I did it!
Stay quiet for all I care!

14:53.108 --> 14:57.608
My Li'l Bomber detects and
follows traces of carbon dioxide.

14:58.905 --> 15:01.616
But living organisms
aren't the only things

15:01.658 --> 15:04.118
that emit the colorless gas.

15:04.161 --> 15:06.997
The combustion of matter also
happens to give off the stuff.

15:08.999 --> 15:10.458
I just remembered…

15:11.084 --> 15:14.087
When I was chasing you
with Li'l Bomber,

15:14.129 --> 15:16.548
I also nailed that car.

15:16.840 --> 15:21.340
I'm also pretty sure I perforated
the hell out of that gas tank…

15:21.678 --> 15:25.431
Now I can't tell exactly where
those bullet holes are from here.

15:25.974 --> 15:27.016
But I can…

15:27.642 --> 15:28.684
That's it…

15:28.768 --> 15:33.022
I remember thinking those
bullet holes were blazing and that…

15:33.106 --> 15:34.857
the carbon dioxide
they were giving off

15:34.900 --> 15:36.693
made them easy pickings
for Li'l Bomber.

15:37.068 --> 15:38.861
So I fired away.

15:38.987 --> 15:42.323
See, I wasn't shooting at
the spider back there.

15:42.365 --> 15:45.117
Those bullet holes were tiny…

15:45.243 --> 15:47.620
so it took a little while
for things to get cooking…

15:47.662 --> 15:49.372
I was getting kinda worried!

15:49.414 --> 15:50.415
What?!

16:02.344 --> 16:03.845
Damn it!

16:04.012 --> 16:08.788
All the stuff I bought
got completely torched!

16:06.598 --> 16:08.766
NARANCIA'S HEIGHT: 5.5CM -> 170.5CM
(HIS NORMAL HEIGHT)

16:09.684 --> 16:12.019
But it sure feels great

16:12.062 --> 16:15.231
to not have to worry
about spider bites anymore.

16:15.440 --> 16:17.442
How dare you!

16:17.526 --> 16:21.988
I'm gonna butcher each and
every one of your stupid friends!

16:22.280 --> 16:25.574
Hideout… Blergh!

16:25.617 --> 16:27.785
Vineyard… Blah!

16:27.869 --> 16:32.164
I hope you've prepared yourself,
Narancia!

16:34.209 --> 16:35.960
Tiny Feet!

16:39.172 --> 16:40.673
W-What?!

16:42.175 --> 16:45.469
He put the fire out with
the blood from his cut wrist?!

16:46.221 --> 16:48.097
Shit, now what?!

16:48.223 --> 16:50.225
I can't let him get away now!

16:50.392 --> 16:52.685
I have to find him
with Li'l Bomber!

16:54.312 --> 16:55.855
Sh-Shit!

16:55.897 --> 16:57.440
Th-The radar…

16:57.816 --> 16:59.609
These flames…

17:01.152 --> 17:02.945
- Y-You bastard!
- This my lucky break?

17:03.029 --> 17:04.697
- Where are you?!
- Narancia,

17:04.739 --> 17:07.616
because you set the car on fire,

17:07.909 --> 17:11.329
the flames are giving off
too much carbon dioxide,

17:11.413 --> 17:13.957
and you can't pin me down!

17:14.165 --> 17:16.083
- Well, I guess it's safe to say
- You're not getting away!

17:16.126 --> 17:17.585
At this point that
the match is set, I win!

17:17.627 --> 17:19.879
I know exactly where to
find the boss's daughter.

17:19.921 --> 17:21.714
Now all I have to do is
ditch this shit hole

17:21.756 --> 17:23.340
and let my team know the good news.

17:23.633 --> 17:26.177
We'll kill you and
all your little mates!

17:26.261 --> 17:29.973
Assassinations are what we do best!

17:30.056 --> 17:31.057
Assassinations?

17:31.099 --> 17:33.434
I'll make sure
we're square real soon!

17:33.476 --> 17:35.603
You won't ever have
to see me again!

17:35.645 --> 17:38.314
I win!

17:40.483 --> 17:41.817
BOOOOOOM

17:44.279 --> 17:47.782
If I can't pinpoint
your stinking breath…

17:48.074 --> 17:51.410
You know,
'cause of that roaring fire…

17:51.453 --> 17:54.622
I'll just have to feed
those flames some more!

18:05.050 --> 18:08.136
Once I light up
this entire freakin' street,

18:08.178 --> 18:09.804
your peewee self
is gonna be crispier

18:09.846 --> 18:11.556
than the bottom of
a pizza margherita!

18:12.098 --> 18:15.351
You're not getting away, Formaggio!

18:17.354 --> 18:20.357
This psycho is deranged.

18:21.191 --> 18:24.027
You actually set
the street on fire!

18:24.319 --> 18:26.946
You cazzo, are you insane!

18:27.322 --> 18:28.531
Huh?!

18:29.199 --> 18:33.161
I guess I don't need to set
the whole city on fire now.

18:33.453 --> 18:36.122
You know, I asked if
you are insane

18:36.164 --> 18:40.664
'cause your actions are telling me
to kill you right here on the spot.

18:42.796 --> 18:44.130
Thanks to your little fire fest,

18:44.172 --> 18:47.008
I was able to sneak in
a lot closer to you.

18:47.217 --> 18:48.551
Did you forget?

18:48.593 --> 18:53.093
At this distance,
my Stand is faster than yours!

18:53.306 --> 18:54.223
It might be.

18:54.307 --> 18:56.684
Bring it, Narancia…

19:08.863 --> 19:10.948
Tiny Feet!

19:17.831 --> 19:20.333
Such a pity…

19:20.375 --> 19:23.044
Guess your little
shopping excursion

19:23.086 --> 19:25.671
wasn't as easy
as you thought it'd be…

19:25.880 --> 19:28.257
was it, Narancia?

19:28.466 --> 19:32.678
Well, things are going to get
a lot worse from here on out…

19:32.721 --> 19:34.639
for all you cazzos!

19:40.729 --> 19:42.856
"Go shopping," they tell me…

19:45.650 --> 19:48.653
Mission failed.

19:48.737 --> 19:50.572
All the money, all the merch…

19:51.072 --> 19:53.449
it's all just a bunch of ashes…

19:55.577 --> 19:57.787
Narancia, I want to hear you
say it again.

19:58.079 --> 19:59.705
I told you, all the stuff—

19:59.748 --> 20:00.915
Not that!

20:00.957 --> 20:03.668
You just said the enemy
found out where we're hiding.

20:03.877 --> 20:05.295
But I took care of him right after—

20:05.378 --> 20:07.338
You think it's just that simple?!

20:07.422 --> 20:10.466
Bucciarati, we need to get
the hell out of here.

20:10.550 --> 20:12.593
After I warned you so many times…

20:12.677 --> 20:14.095
You fool!

20:15.388 --> 20:16.806
Narancia managed to
thwart the enemy,

20:16.848 --> 20:18.891
he should be commended.

20:19.601 --> 20:23.313
He did everything
he should've done.

20:23.354 --> 20:26.440
And now that the Hitman Team
figured us out,

20:26.483 --> 20:30.983
a sensible boss would tell us
how to get out of this mess.

20:32.447 --> 20:34.365
I think we should stay right here

20:34.449 --> 20:36.701
until we receive further word
from the boss.

20:37.327 --> 20:39.454
Listen, everyone,
for the prodigy speaks.

20:39.496 --> 20:41.414
I didn't realize
you were our new adviser.

20:41.873 --> 20:46.294
What makes you think the boss
will contact us any time soon?

20:46.377 --> 20:48.170
Guessing your way out of this
doesn't help us, kid!

20:48.254 --> 20:49.255
Bucciarati!

20:49.464 --> 20:51.591
I think we got a message
from the boss!

20:56.471 --> 20:58.014
MESSAGE FOR BUCCIARATI

20:58.348 --> 21:01.517
The boss always sends
his directives to capos this way.

21:01.810 --> 21:04.687
But this is the first time
one's been sent to Bucciarati…

21:05.396 --> 21:06.772
Let me review the directive.

21:09.734 --> 21:11.277
Proceed to the ancient site
of Pompeii.

21:11.820 --> 21:15.365
I have hidden a key
near the cave canem mosaic.

21:15.615 --> 21:16.657
Investigate, ragazzi!

21:22.288 --> 21:24.373
The key operates the vehicle

21:24.415 --> 21:28.001
that will allow you to safely
transport my daughter to me.

21:28.044 --> 21:31.005
Vehicle? What kind of vehicle
would allow us to do that?

21:31.047 --> 21:32.840
A helicopter!

21:32.882 --> 21:35.342
That must be a key to a helicopter!

21:35.385 --> 21:38.262
We can go anywhere in a helicopter
without anyone following us!

21:38.805 --> 21:41.766
Pompeii is a little less than
fifteen kilometers away.

21:41.850 --> 21:45.728
An hour should be more than enough
to get there and get the key.

21:45.937 --> 21:48.564
Fugo! Abbacchio! Giorno!

21:48.648 --> 21:51.400
You three will travel to Pompeii
to secure that key!

21:51.860 --> 21:53.653
Mista, Narancia, and I
will remain here

21:53.695 --> 21:56.072
and protect Trish
from the Hitman Team.

21:56.698 --> 21:58.282
Retrieve the key,

21:58.366 --> 22:00.368
and when the situation is secure,
radio back.

22:00.410 --> 22:04.247
That's when we will meet you
with Trish at the vehicle.

22:05.290 --> 22:06.291
God speed, my men.

23:38.091 --> 23:41.969
EPISODE 12
THE SECOND MISSION FROM THE BOSS
